pirate-arcade (2.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix launcher PRESS START text overlap — reduced font from 72px to 36px
    to prevent overlapping adjacent game cards.
  * Fix launcher card title/description spacing for better readability.
  * Fix Port Royale Tycoon menu panel rebuilt every frame — panel now cached
    and only recreated when item count changes.
  * Fix build_deb.sh to use fakeroot for proper root file ownership in .deb.
  * Fix CI macOS build-exe upload path to handle .app bundle output.

